<p>Hi <%= @contributor.key_contact.presence || @contributor.company_name %>,</p>

<p>Project upload access has been enabled for <strong><%= @contributor.company_name %></strong> in the iQs Jobs portal.</p>

<dl>
  <dt>Login email</dt>
  <dd><%= @user.email %></dd>

  <dt>Portal</dt>
  <dd>
    <%= link_to "Set up your password", edit_user_password_url(reset_password_token: @setup_token) %>
  </dd>
</dl>

<p>Use the setup link to choose your password before signing in. If you already have a password, you can use this link to update it.</p>

<p>Thanks,<br>the iQs Team</p>
